# Privacy and deletion

- Process files only to convert. No training, profiling, ads, SEO, or external AI/OCR in P0.
- Never store extracted resume text in the DB, logs, queue, or analytics.
- Job ID is not authorization. Secrets never go in URLs, referrers, or events.
- Do not display deleted until storage, temp disks, multipart uploads, and DB reconcile.
- Tombstones win over workers. Lifecycle policies are not proof of deletion.
- Redact filenames, tokens, bodies, and document snapshots.
